<TR>
<TD WIDTH=15% VALIGN=top>
<I>Software for Custom Packaging of Handbook Material for Teaching</I>
</TD>
<TD WIDTH=85%>
This page will contain information on Course Builder, software for custom
packaging of Handbook material for teaching specialized courses.  A prototype
version of Course Builder has been demonstrated at several conferences and
meetings and seminars, however, it is not currently ready for prime time.  
Based on what we have learned using the prototype, we are re-writing the
software in Java to make it more robust and user friendly.  As a result, this
page is only a placeholder for Course Builder information right now.  Check
back here soon for more information.
</TD>
</TR>

<TR>
<TD WIDTH=15% VALIGN=top>
<I></I>
</TD>
<TD WIDTH=85%>
<A TARGET="_parent" HREF="../../../../luser-bin/course-builder.pl">Prototype Version of Course Builder</A>
</TD>
